<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερπετής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flying over</i> or
				<i>above,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ τείχους ὑπερπετῆ γιγνόμενα τὰ
					βέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					32.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλη ὑ. τῶν πρωτοστατῶν
			φερόμενα</span> darts <i>flying over</i> their <i>heads,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.30.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ὄρνεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					5.4.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ.</span>”
				<i>all that flies over,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.1.38
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. πνεῖν,</span> of winds, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				15.3.10
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>high-flying,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pr.Im.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stretching beyond, reaching high,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωράκια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.4.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάλαγξ</span>”
				<i>outflanking,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.11
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῆς πνοῆς</span>”
				<i>far above,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυφὴ -εστέρα τῆς καμήλου</span>”
				<i>reaching higher,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					16.4.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν βίᾳ τις τὸ κλύσμα ἐνθλίβων
				ὑπερπετὲς αὐτὸ ποιήσῃ</span>
			<i>too high,</i> Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.38.9
			</span></i>.</div>
